OL,3,GNEWSANew plan to get more new mums
OL,4,Abreastfeeding
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen living in deprived parts of
OL,7,FLincolnshire are almost four times less
OL,8,Flikely to breastfeed than mothers in
OL,9,Fother areas, according to council
OL,10,Fbosses.
OL,12,FLincolnshire County Council has
OL,13,Flaunched a new six-year strategy aimed
OL,14,Fat increasing breastfeeding rates by
OL,15,Feducating and supporting families.
OL,17,FIt comes as the number of mothers
OL,18,Fbreastfeeding in the UK remains among
OL,19,Fthe lowest in the world, the authority
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
